[{"title":"寿亲","author":"李时行","text":"太母年登百岁期，老亲八帙亦庞眉。\n开筵正值黄花候，倚杖重看白发垂。\n膝下曾玄欣笑舞，尊前兄弟奏埙篪。\n寒门共庆天伦乐，富贵人间总未知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9373,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登楼","author":"李时行","text":"海门摇落动新秋，览胜同登江上楼。\n十里蒹葭黄叶渡，几家烟火白蘋洲。\n远山历历数可尽，野水盈盈寒不流。\n自愧冯高强能赋，且将樽酒坐销忧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9374,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"燕京怀友","author":"李时行","text":"客愁不为食无鱼，倚剑临风叹索居。\n燕地雪深寒独早，衡阳雁远信应疏。\n狂来阮籍惟耽酒，病去虞卿祇著书。\n满目烽烟关塞隔，故人消息近何如。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9375,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"海珠寺登眺","author":"李时行","text":"花宫寂寂俯中流，四望风烟入早秋。\n赤日浮光摇海树，青山倒影射江楼。\n梵钟渔笛时相和，去鸟归云各自由。\n清兴每从方外得，不因尊酒重淹留。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9376,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"得家书寄云屏弟","author":"李时行","text":"粤南燕北转逶迤，水阔天高雁到迟。\n梦里生涯元是幻，尘中世路本多歧。\n几回驻马瞻云舍，忽谩题诗忆草池。\n王事关心浑未已，危楼一上一相思。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9377,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋夜滕王阁登眺答林舍人见寄","author":"李时行","text":"滕王高阁入虚清，万里银河倚槛横。\n七泽风烟秋澹澹，九江波浪夜冥冥。\n斗间不见龙骖影，云外空闻凤吹声。\n千载独留歌舞地，西山月色向人明。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9378,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"与徐长谷谈秦中山水","author":"李时行","text":"终南少室敞遥天，曲径斜盘万壑烟。\n春煖三花香霭合，云开二华翠微连。\n金光夜映瑶台草，珠露朝含玉井莲。\n拟采流霞泛丹液，双飞凫舄下秦川。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9379,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送何员外之南都","author":"李时行","text":"金陵自古帝王城，此去仙帆几日程。\n鳷鹊观前秋水绿，凤凰台上晚风清。\n身归省署新承宠，道在河汾旧著名。\n惜别天涯惊岁暮，陇云江树总含情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9380,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜坐","author":"李时行","text":"松风敲剑壁，花露滴琴床。\n坐对前峰月，空山丛桂香。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9381,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江上送客","author":"李时行","text":"君家隔江□，别舸乘潮去。\n明日潮复来，还应望君至。","collection":"明","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9382,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"伊州歌","author":"李时行","text":"闻道移军去，音书谁为传。\n渔阳万里道，一梦到君前。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9383,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"商妇吟二首 其一","author":"李时行","text":"自君客淮水，十载歇欢爱。\n如何牛女星，犹得年年会。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9384,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"商妇吟二首 其二","author":"李时行","text":"露压树枝低，门前乌夜啼。\n乌啼因甚恶，嗟尔亦双栖。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9385,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏美人","author":"李时行","text":"织月生眉黛，香风出舞衣。\n乍疑湘水见，还似洛川归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9386,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江南曲二首 其一","author":"李时行","text":"荡舟若耶渚，日午不知暑。\n隔湖风雨来，桨入荷花里。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9387,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江南曲二首 其二","author":"李时行","text":"采采玉莲花，莫采池中藕。\n采藕藕丝长，采花香在手。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9388,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"古意","author":"李时行","text":"花落春愁暗，莺啼晓梦醒。\n柳丝长若许，难系别离情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9389,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"对酒","author":"李时行","text":"花落还再春，人老无复少。\n高歌对美酒，且向花前笑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9390,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杂咏","author":"李时行","text":"芳草怨王孙，竹枝悲楚客。\n唯有阶下萱，忘忧自朝夕。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9391,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春山","author":"李时行","text":"春山殊气候，十里半阴晴。\n山下三更雨，山头月正明。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9392,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山中饮","author":"李时行","text":"山鸟唤客游，山花劝客饮。\n醉来石上眠，瑶琴当高枕。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9393,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"访山僧","author":"李时行","text":"山僧爱留客，閒坐开竹扉。\n为办青精饭，春盘笋蕨肥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9394,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"深谷草","author":"李时行","text":"最爱深谷草，领取风光迟。\n直待春将半，青青发嫩丝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9395,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江南乐四首 其一","author":"李时行","text":"人言江南乐，江南信不恶。\n冬杪宛如春，寒花发新萼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9396,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江南乐四首 其二","author":"李时行","text":"五月荔子红，香味胜如蜜。\n有时泛小舟，雪藕采菱实。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9397,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江南乐四首 其三","author":"李时行","text":"江南多海味，异品四时有。\n秋风紫蟹肥，呼朋酌新酒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9398,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江南乐四首 其四","author":"李时行","text":"生居炎暖地，不见雪霜飞。\n一冬看欲尽，犹未著寒衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9399,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"弹琴","author":"李时行","text":"竹下弹素琴，空山秋意深。\n竹声杂琴韵，泠然太古音。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9400,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"照镜","author":"李时行","text":"青镜不容丝，妍媸照自知。\n朱颜与白发，相去不多时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9401,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"有感","author":"李时行","text":"交游倾海内，何如骨肉亲。\n悠悠行路者，谁是素心人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9402,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"台夜","author":"李时行","text":"登台不见月，空有列星光。\n北斗涌地出，西风吹众芳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9403,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"邯郸行 其一","author":"李时行","text":"陌上经过侠少年，邀予一饮钱十千。\n醉来马上扬鞭去，还向红楼高处眠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9404,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"邯郸行 其二","author":"李时行","text":"风吹大雪似花飞，飞花乱扑沾人衣。\n燕姬当垆劝客饮，兴剧那能不醉归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9405,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"邯郸行 其三","author":"李时行","text":"邯郸新酒香馥馥，邯郸佳人美如玉。\n琵琶乱拨霜月高，醉倚胡床歌一曲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9406,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"邯郸行 其四","author":"李时行","text":"相逢意气轻王侯，笑把金鞭当酒筹。\n露坐呼卢浮大白，不知风雪满貂裘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9407,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"风","author":"李时行","text":"北风吹沙地欲裂，绕树寒鸦惊落叶。\n闭门醉卧客不来，窗外飞霜白如雪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9408,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"观潮","author":"李时行","text":"白浪如山拍岸鸣，钱唐六月看潮生。\n朝来无限扁舟渡，莫谓风波不可行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9409,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"舟中逢张石川通参","author":"李时行","text":"我向金陵访古邱，君从天姥石梁游。\n共看一道吴江水，分作东西两地流。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9410,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"姑苏别仲弟云屏南归","author":"李时行","text":"水阔三江路渺茫，蒹葭含露月苍苍。\n同来未得同归去，愁对西风鸿雁行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9411,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"归云庵","author":"李时行","text":"四壁苍烟覆古藤，佛龛长照万年灯。\n闭门尽日闻啼鸟，閒杀山中饱睡僧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9412,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题女道士院","author":"李时行","text":"晓汲云泉灌药畦，仙家宛似武陵溪。\n春来两岸桃花发，莫把刘郎归路迷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9413,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"都门观别","author":"李时行","text":"邮亭官柳乱啼莺，几处笙歌送客行。\n歧路东西不同去，春风一样别离情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9414,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闺情","author":"李时行","text":"女萝飘绿上窗纱，墙角东风燕子斜。\n绕遍空庭春寂寂，半帘疏雨落梨花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9415,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"侠客行","author":"李时行","text":"壮志平生鄙贰师，酒酣弹剑复扬眉。\n堂中养就三千士，白日报仇人不知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9416,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"古边词","author":"李时行","text":"万里龙沙战未休，年年烽火为防秋。\n功成不受封侯赏，诸将相看尽白头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9417,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"得家书","author":"李时行","text":"一纸乡书来万里，独怜游子客天涯。\n书中纵有千言语，总是丁宁早到家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9418,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题西湖石壁","author":"李时行","text":"花映楼台日日春，湖中烟景世无邻。\n千年惟有青山在，见尽无穷歌舞人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9419,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"相逢行","author":"李时行","text":"相逢杯酒罄交欢，转眼真成按剑看。\n千古相知推管鲍，同心直到白头难。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9420,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赏花","author":"李时行","text":"山童昨报花正开，携酒看花日日来。\n酒亦爱花花爱客，醉眠花下不知回。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9421,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"访王景甫岘山草堂","author":"李时行","text":"与君共醉岘山春，千树万树桃花新。\n几度携琴下山去，山中猿鹤解留人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9422,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠张书记出大同","author":"李时行","text":"白面书生为国忧，奋随骠骑出边头。\n此行不羡封侯乐，但愿轻身雪□仇。","collection":"明","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9423,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"匡南府夜宴 其一","author":"李时行","text":"瑶阶飞雪隔帘看，锦帐藏春夜未阑。\n醉倚小屏听艳曲，绮罗香暖不知寒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9424,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"匡南府夜宴 其二","author":"李时行","text":"低回舞袖座生风，弦管声沉玉漏中。\n不用待儿相促劝，金杯到手尽成空。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9425,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"匡南府夜宴 其三","author":"李时行","text":"乘兴移尊傍翠萝，美人秉烛对花歌。\n蕊宫自与人间异，春色偏于夜里多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9426,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"渔父词","author":"李时行","text":"半醉渔翁卧短蓑，大儿吹笛小儿歌。\n月明更向芦湾宿，世上风波奈尔何。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9427,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠庐山老僧","author":"李时行","text":"不下匡山七十年，衲衣空挂碧岩烟。\n相逢不问人间事，头白眉长已过肩。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9428,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游仙词","author":"李时行","text":"一上瑶台露气浓，参差万朵绿芙蓉。\n鼎烹石髓调玄鹤，剑拂云衣跨玉龙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9429,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"访罗浮道士不遇","author":"李时行","text":"石床丹灶紫烟消，万玉峰头是铁桥。\n开遍碧桃人不见，隔林时有彩霞飘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9430,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠朱箴","author":"李时行","text":"鼎里黄金何日成，尊中绿酒且须倾。\n忘机惟有沙鸥鸟，流水浮云亦世情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9431,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠别王舍人化","author":"李时行","text":"紫骝雕控入燕云，金马门前凤作群。\n千里相思蒋陵夜，几番清梦更逢君。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9432,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"别刘吉卿","author":"李时行","text":"黄木湾头湾水平，朱明洞里鹧鸪声。\n春江二月仙帆去，倚剑看云无限情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9433,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"奉天","author":"李时行","text":"紫禁轻寒积翠深，上方宫殿故阴阴。\n千门草霁春光早，九陌风清昼漏沉。\n剑佩但随鹓鹭列，云霄常捧战竞心。\n圣明此日多封诏，遥向天池候玉音。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9434,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"乌啼曲","author":"李时行","text":"十月十日严风嘶，四野无云天外凄。\n捲帘步阶见新月，辉辉静与银潢齐。\n银潢渺渺不可接，美人隔我河梁西。\n褰裳岂谢舟车阻，烟雾横江江水迷。\n玉楼伫立明星灿，曲里停砧天宇低。\n霜寒露冷悲鼓角，思君愁听夜乌啼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9435,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游天坛赠刘澹庵羽士","author":"李时行","text":"天上仙人白玉裳，青门路入水云乡。\n神州地僻烟霞迥，秘府春深日月长。\n露满碧梧鸾起舞，风清黄道鹤回翔。\n披图尽日穷玄览，飞舄期君出尚方。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9436,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送友人赴边","author":"李时行","text":"烽火照祁连，三军复驻边。\n寒笳悲汉月，塞草接胡烟。\n按甲秋□□，□□□□□。\n□□应献捷，刻石继燕然。","collection":"明","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9437,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"慈恩寺","author":"李时行","text":"梵王宫阙枕江流，胜地遥连汉苑秋。\n十里波光摇合浦，四围山色落晴洲。\n灵花散后诸天静，慧鸟啼时小洞幽。\n更就远公谈妙法，令人心赏更淹留。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9438,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"冬夜期友人不至","author":"李时行","text":"今夕风色寒，月白虚庭敞。\n美人来何迟，芳兴期同赏。\n落叶下林皋，流萤度珠网。\n遥望碧云浮，渺渺悬遐想。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9439,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋日登山有感","author":"李时行","text":"龙山天畔独登临，触目中原动壮心。\n落日松篁生紫气，高秋云物送清阴。\n东南波浪回天地，西北关河自古今。\n已见王师收上郡，将军莫遣姓名沈。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9440,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"早秋","author":"李时行","text":"帘捲轻风生午凉，槿花半落野棠香。\n山深白日柴门静，松外烟消鹤梦长。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9441,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"九日","author":"李时行","text":"与客同登蓟北台，菊花元傍晚阳开。\n风回陌上燕云起，木落霜前朔雁来。\n最爱孟嘉能落帽，不妨陶令重衔杯。\n欣逢佳节须乘兴，陇笛胡笳暮更催。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9442,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"泰泉山中观泉","author":"李时行","text":"江南佳胜地，帘泉擅幽奇。\n危岑悬万仞，径石回参差。\n岩端蔼瑞露，涧底生灵芝。\n阴崖寒逼袂，回峰翠成围。\n班荆俯流水，坐石看残碑。\n鸾歌杂樵语，宾从相谐嬉。\n十年注幽想，兹辰慰所思。\n顾瞻还踯躅，游盘下逶迤。\n禅关昔宏敞，接目空遗基。\n□□理所干，往事安足疑。\n惟有遨游侣，千秋长若斯。","collection":"明","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9443,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄徐子","author":"李时行","text":"穷爱南州徐孺子，风流文采向人高。\n十年岭海双龙剑，千里云霄一布袍。\n醉后有诗题竹叶，枕边无梦听松涛。\n拂衣我欲沧浪去，回首清歌羡汝曹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9444,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"与萧龙石夜坐","author":"李时行","text":"客地相逢日，孤灯夜话时。\n看花频拂麈，对酒重论诗。\n月落乌声切，天寒雁影迟。\n无何成远别，应此系吾思。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9445,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿小金山","author":"李时行","text":"香阁临浈水，灵山控粤城。\n雨深青藓合，潮长白云平。\n野鹤依人舞，岩花对客清。\n禅房独欹枕，惟有暮钟声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9446,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宗丰城侯","author":"李时行","text":"曾趋东阁拜平津，满座图书万象新。\n日映彤墀仪凤鸟，风高窗省列麒麟。\n清尊锦瑟招贤地，铁券金貂报主身。\n千载皇图磐石固，好将忠赤侍枫宸。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9447,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"风光楼","author":"李时行","text":"风光楼上望乡关，树杪云开见远山。\n目极长江渺无际，落霞天外鸟空还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9448,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}}]